        desc: "Martinique holds the only full AOC (Appellation d'Origine Contrôlée) in rum — the AOC Martinique Rhum Agricole. All Martinique AOC rum must be made from fresh sugarcane juice (not molasses), distilled to a specific strength range (65-75% abv), and aged in oak barrels for designated periods (Vieux = minimum 3 years). The style is distinctively grassy, vegetal, and expressive of sugarcane terroir.",
